<title>USA: U.S. DAP central Florida cash prices up on demand.</title>
<headline>U.S. DAP central Florida cash prices up on demand.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. cash diammonium phosphate quotes in central Florida were were lower Monday in quiet dealings, cash sources said.</p>
<p>The ammonia market was also quiet, sources said.</p>
<p>			    Dlrs/short ton	Chg from Friday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla	   177-182			dn 9</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf     182-184			unc</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf	   225-228			unc-up 3</p>
<p>--(Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720)</p>
</text>
